ImageViewer patch (docs/PLAN.md section 15, D-57): upstream's fix of a heap overflow in NLT marker parsing
Library: openjph 0.32.0
Fixes: none in OSV (OSS-Fuzz issue 566653567, found through OpenEXR)
Upstream: aous72/OpenJPH b7b2dee (#384), on master after 0.32.0
Remove when: a release contains b7b2dee (the update script removes a patch the release already contains)

param_nlt::read() read the whole allocation's length into marker_points, which starts partway
into it: a heap out-of-bounds write from an NLT marker with one byte per point (HTJ2K inside
EXR). Upstream's commit, unchanged.

